<title>UK: London PGMS finish sharply lower, gold just easier.</title>
<headline>London PGMS finish sharply lower, gold just easier.</headline>
<text>
<p>PLATINUM - Closes at $440.10/$445.10, down from Monday's close of $464.00/$469.00. Depressed by news Russian exports may be nearing resumption.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Ends at $205.60/210.60, versus $221.00/$231.00.</p>
<p>GOLD - Finishes at $343.50/344.00 versus $344.00/$344.50 after quiet, rangebound day.</p>
<p>SILVER - Ends off five cents at $4.77/4.79.</p>
</text>
